# Web layout — vertical modules

The SPA lives under `web/src/`. This repo uses **vertical modules** (`tasks/`, `projects/`, …), not `src/features/`. Boundaries are enforced by `scripts/check-code-standards.ps1` and [ADR-0044](../../docs/adr/ADR-0044-query-invalidation-catalog.md).

**Companion:** file-size limits in `CODE_STANDARDS.mdc`. UI quality: `frontend_bar.mdc`. Tests: `web-testing-bar.mdc`. Data policy: [docs/web.md](../../docs/web.md).

---

## Directory layout (actual)

```
web/src/
├── app/                    # Shell: App.tsx, Router, providers, bootstrap, global styles
│   └── styles/             # Global + feature CSS (tokens under styles/tokens/)
├── api/                    # ALL fetch() calls — parseTaskApi* parsers live here
├── components/             # Domain-agnostic UI (ui/, layout/, feedback/, …)
├── hooks/                  # Shared hooks with no vertical dependency
├── lib/                    # Inner ring: query policy, invalidation catalog, git assignment
├── types/                  # Wire types shared across verticals (taskCore, cycle, project, …)
├── shared/                 # Small shared UI/helpers (toast, error boundary, …)
├── tasks/                  # Task vertical (largest): pages, sync, mutations, create, checklist
├── projects/               # Projects vertical
├── settings/               # Settings vertical
├── worktrees/              # Git worktree UI (legacy name; global git hooks live in hooks/)
├── observability/          # System status chip, etc.
└── test/                   # MSW server, handlers, factories, integration harnesses
```

### Vertical module shape (example: `tasks/`)

```
tasks/
├── pages/                  # Route containers (*Page.tsx) — thin
├── components/             # Feature UI
├── hooks/                  # Task-specific hooks
├── sync/                   # SSE cache policy (decideSyncFrame, applySyncEffects)
├── mutations/              # Guarded optimistic writes
├── create/                 # Create-flow decide/apply (ADR-0024)
├── checklist/              # Detail checklist mutations
├── task-query/             # Query keys + list/detail hooks
└── index.ts                # Narrow public exports for app/ lazy routes
```

---

## Module boundary rules

### Inner ring (cross-vertical)

Promote to `lib/`, `hooks/`, or `components/` when **two or more** verticals need the same code:

- Query invalidation: `lib/queryInvalidation/`
- Git assignment: `lib/composeGitAssignment.ts`, `hooks/useComposeGitAssignment.ts`
- Project picker: `components/project/`, `hooks/useProjects.ts`

`tasks/` must **not** import `@/projects/` or `@/worktrees/` directly — use the inner ring. Enforced in CI.

### Vertical isolation

| Vertical | Must not import from |
| --- | --- |
| `tasks/` | `projects/`, `worktrees/` |
| `projects/` | `tasks/`, `settings/`, `worktrees/` |
| `settings/` | `tasks/`, `projects/`, `worktrees/` |
| `worktrees/` | `tasks/`, `projects/`, `settings/` |

Shared concepts → `types/` or `api/`, not cross-vertical deep imports.

### Other rules

- **`api/`** — sole owner of `fetch()`. Responses are `unknown` until `parseTaskApi*` validates.
- **`components/`** — domain-agnostic; no imports from `tasks/` or other verticals.
- **`hooks/`** (top-level) — no imports from `api/tasks` or vertical paths; vertical hooks live under `tasks/hooks/`, etc.
- **Mutations** — project/git `invalidateQueries` only in `*/mutations/` modules (see check script).
- **Pure policy modules** — `tasks/mutations/*.ts` and `tasks/create/*.ts` (non-test) must not import React.

---

## API parsers (BC-aligned)

Parsers mirror backend bounded contexts:

| Module | Backend BC |
| --- | --- |
| `api/parseTaskApiCore.ts` | Shared parse helpers + enums |
| `api/parseTaskApiTasks.ts` | taskcore task list/get/stats |
| `api/parseTaskApiCycles.ts` | taskcycles |
| `api/parseTaskApiEvents.ts` | taskevents |
| `api/parseTaskApiCompose.ts` | drafts/templates |
| `api/parseTaskApi.ts` | Barrel re-exports only |

Types: `types/taskCore.ts`, `types/cycle.ts`, `types/taskDrafts.ts`, … — barrel via `types/index.ts`.

---

## Dependency graph

```
app/
  └── tasks/, projects/, settings/ (vertical pages)
        └── api/, types/, components/, hooks/, lib/
              └── (no imports from verticals)
```

---

## CI enforcement

`npm run check:standards` → `scripts/check-code-standards.ps1`:

- `fetch(` only under `web/src/api/` (excluding tests)
- Vertical cross-import matrix (table above)
- Raw colors / sub-minimum font sizes in component CSS
- `invalidateQueries` scoped to `mutations/` in projects/worktrees

---

